    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the fundamentals of the Japanese language with <strong>Kana</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you get to learn and practice <strong>Hiragana</strong> and <strong>Katakana</strong> which are the syllabaries of the Japanese language.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don't know what that means, it's basically the &quot;alphabets&quot; of Japanese.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice Hiragana and Katakana in the learning hub. It contains a chart and an endless mode that makes memorizing them easier.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn how to write each character with a stroke order visualizer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with the world or your friends and see who's best! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the fundamentals of the Japanese language with <strong>Kana</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you get to learn and practice <strong>Hiragana</strong> and <strong>Katakana</strong> which are the syllabaries of the Japanese language.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don't know what that means, it's basically the &quot;alphabets&quot; of Japanese.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice Hiragana and Katakana in the learning hub. It contains a chart and an endless mode that makes memorizing them easier.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn how to write each character with a stroke order visualizer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with the world or your friends and see who's best! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Start your Japanese learning journey by learning the fundamentals! In Kana, you get to practice Hiragana and Katakana, which are two of the writing systems in Japanese.",
